From f5c2ca97ed8a25ac5117eb23dedb4823b85f5397 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mohammed Awal Bawah Issah <mohammedawalbawahissah@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 14:09:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add AgriRevolution app icon across web and mobile

New brand mark (sun rising over converging furrows with a sprout at the
vanishing point) in the existing terracotta/gold/navy palette.

Web: favicon (svg + ico), apple-touch icon, PWA manifest + icons, page
title; logo on login, register, portal sidebar, phone-width header and
AI assistant panel.

Mobile: app icon, Android adaptive + themed monochrome layers, splash,
favicon; new BrandLogo component used in the shared tab header, loading
screen, login, register and AI assistant header.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01U2rmzbsxKcA42nebDAvHEx
